k about the One Direction fandom</a></b> as one of the best books of 2022?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Everything_I_Need_I_Get_from_You","retrieved":1791374156646},{"title":"an Anglican bishop (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eraste_Bigirimana\" title=\"Eraste Bigirimana\">an Anglican bishop</a></b> sits on the National Security Council of Burundi?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eraste_Bigirimana","retrieved":1791374156647},{"title":"Down the Mine (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that \"<b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Down_the_Mine\" title=\"Down the Mine\">Down the Mine</a></b>\" was released to the public more than 40 years after production began?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Down_the_Mine","retrieved":1791374156649},{"title":"Anny Schlemm (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anny_Schlemm\" title=\"Anny Schlemm\">Anny Schlemm</a></b>, simultaneously a member of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Komische_Oper_Berlin\" title=\"Komische Oper Berlin\">Komische Oper Berlin</a> from 1949 and the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oper_Frankfurt\" title=\"Oper Frankfurt\">Oper Frankfurt</a> from 1952, performed 135 roles between 1946 and 2003?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anny_Schlemm","retrieved":1791374156652},{"title":"groups of unemployed young men who drink tea (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fada_(social_group)\" title=\"Fada (social group)\">groups of unemployed young men who drink tea</a></b> play a role in crime prevention in Niger?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fada_(social_group)","retrieved":1791374156653},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<